{"lyrics":"[00:00.42](Southside On The Track, Yeah)\n[00:08.76]Uh-huh, Southside\n[00:11.08]Yeah, mm, ayy, tossin', turnin' in my sleep, I'm dreamin' of burnin' in misery\n[00:19.26]Good times, never seem to last for me\n[00:22.50]I'm fine, life is just a sad thing (Life is just a sad thing)\n[00:25.88]Got me hurtin', screamin', gettin' no peace\n[00:29.10]Cupid got his ass out, tryna shit on me\n[00:32.42]Good times, never seem to last for me\n[00:35.66]I'm fine, life is just a sad thing (Life is just a sad thing)\n[00:39.36]As I walk the sidewalk, some sleepless nights and bad thoughts\n[00:45.80]When my prescriptions wear off, ayy\n[00:50.06]Trapped in, passed out and drunk in the back of a wagon, Benz, wagon\n[00:55.88]Bitches love to tell tall tales, waggin'\n[00:59.06]I know that I'm a dog, but still blood hounds feel pain like a human feels\n[01:06.14]What's the deal? I want it to chill-chill\n[01:08.56]Tryna numb my soul, I might just take a few pills\n[01:11.94]I ain't okay, but I made it still my will\n[01:15.16]Who gon' speak for the fallen? I guess I will\n[01:18.48]Yeah, mm, ayy, tossin', turnin' in my sleep, I'm dreamin' of burnin' in misery\n[01:25.02]Good times, never seem to last for me\n[01:28.24]I'm fine, life is just a sad thing (Life is just a sad thing)\n[01:31.60]Got me hurtin', screamin', gettin' no peace\n[01:34.94]Cupid got his ass out, tryna shit on me\n[01:38.18]Good times, never seem to last for me\n[01:41.14]I'm fine, life is just a sad thing (Life is just a sad thing)\n[01:45.18]This shit gettin' borin', life's a disappointment\n[01:48.30]I've been out on break though, like I'm double-jointed\n[01:51.74]Seen it with my eyes closed, hidin' from my torment\n[01:54.94]Uh, what you say, bitch? Uh, oh, I hate this\n[01:58.32]This shit never makes sense, no explanation\n[02:01.62]Bitch, I'm not from NASA, but this drama got me spacin'\n[02:04.90]Always frown, down and out, throw up than throw in the towel\n[02:08.20]This a touchy subject lik